//! Tests for the `tui.ts` port: upstream test scenarios (tui-render,
//! tui-shrink, tui-cell-size-input, tui-overlay-style-leak,
//! overlay-options, overlay-non-capturing) plus byte-exact oracle
//! comparisons against the real upstream `tui.ts` run under node
//! (`tests/fixtures/tui_oracle/`).
//!
//! The concrete `doRender` is not part of tui.ts, so `ReferenceRenderer`
//! carries the core of tui-main-screen.ts `doRender` (non-Kitty paths,
//! single buffered flush, no crash/debug logs), mirroring the oracle's
//! TestTui on the node side. `send_input` + `poll_terminal_events` +
//! scripted focus actions reproduce the upstream synchronous callback
//! ordering one event at a time.

